From 7afe2be7657f024c5f3aa627d53e1c290228a509 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 00:21:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): collapsible clarify float panel

Add a collapse/expand button to the clarify float panel (both
MessageList and GroupChatPanel). When collapsed, the panel shrinks
to a single header row so long multi-line choices no longer obscure
chat messages; the message list bottom padding shrinks accordingly.
New clarify resets to expanded. Adds clarifyCollapse/clarifyExpand
i18n keys in all 11 locales.
